# Original Idea

`hark adopt` for moving around what's active, a kind of lock on the session and which lets you pull to a new one. Agent should do so automatically on user initializaiton of hark, and should cuatiously do it if they need it and it's last used somewhere else. as part of this agents need a way to see recent activity to judge whether to adopt it (take control of mic/speakers interface) or not.

